b.add(S1, 313, "match", "Match each rheumatological/root cause to its printed expansion — 1) Takayasu arteritis 2) Behcet disease 3) Cogan syndrome 4) IgG4-related disease … A) Large-vessel vasculitis B) Aortitis + interstitial keratitis + vestibulitis C) No expansion printed D) No expansion printed", "1-C, 2-D, 3-B, 4-A", ["1-A, 2-C, 3-B, 4-D", "1-C, 2-B, 3-D, 4-A", "1-B, 2-D, 3-C, 4-A"], "The branch prints Takayasu arteritis and Behcet disease without expansions, Cogan syndrome as aortitis + interstitial keratitis + vestibulitis and IgG4-related disease as large-vessel vasculitis.")
