b.add(S1, 313, "recall", "Which formula and LVEDP status are printed for compensated mild–moderate AR?", "EF = (EDV − ESV)/EDV, with EF normal or increased and LVEDP normal", ["EF = ESV/(EDV + ESV), with EF low and LVEDP raised", "EF = EDV/ESV, with EF fixed and LVEDP zero", "EF = SBP − DBP, with EF low and LVEDP normal"], "The printed equation is EF = (end-diastolic volume − end-systolic volume)/EDV; EF is N/↑ and LVEDP is N.")
