b.add(S2, 314, "recall", "Which two pulse definitions close page 314?", "High-volume pulse: more blood in LV → increased EF → increased volume; water-hammer/collapsing pulse: high-volume pulse with routes for exit", ["High-volume pulse: low EF → low volume; collapsing pulse: sustained apex", "High-volume pulse: aortic stenosis; collapsing pulse: complete valve closure", "High-volume pulse: bradycardia; collapsing pulse: reduced pulse pressure"], "The clinical-findings lines define HVP as increased LV blood → increased EF → increased volume and water-hammer/collapsing pulse as HVP with routes for exit.")
