b.add(S4, 316, "numeric", "Which three numerical thresholds are embedded in the peripheral-signs table?", "Hill >20 mmHg, Mayne >15 mmHg and Sherman age >75 years", ["Hill >15 mmHg, Mayne >20 mmHg and Sherman age >50 years", "Hill >75 mmHg, Mayne >25 mmHg and Sherman age >20 years", "Hill >20 mmHg, Mayne >15 mmHg and Sherman age >55 years"], "The printed values are >20 mm Hg, >15 mm Hg and age >75 years.")
